t":"F","n":"section","r":[224,585.66,992,1489.92],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"ch":[{"t":"F","n":"div","r":[224,585.66,616.58,1393.92],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"ch":[{"t":"T","n":"Real estate companies account for a mean","r":[224,605.66,592.45,68.5],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"Real estate companies account for a meaningful slice of EGX market cap, yet they're frequently misread by analysts applying industrial-company frameworks to a fundamentally different business model.","lines":3,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"The Egyptian listed real estate sector i","r":[224,704.66,609.31,121],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"The Egyptian listed real estate sector includes TALAT (Talaat Moustafa Group), OCDI (Orascom Development), PHD (Palm Hills Development), and MNHD (Madinet Nasr Housing), among others. Each operates differently, but they share one characteristic: the land bank is the business.","lines":5,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"Why NAV matters more than P/E","r":[224,879.91,475.69,43],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"Why NAV matters more than P/E","lines":1,"tx":{"s":30,"f":"Poppins","w":300,"lh":34.5,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"For most companies, you start with earni","r":[224,949.3,603.89,94.75],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"For most companies, you start with earnings. For Egyptian real estate developers, you start with the land bank — what they own, what it's worth at today's prices, and how many years of development it represents.","lines":4,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"Net Asset Value (NAV) is the sum of the ","r":[224,1074.55,591.23,121],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"Net Asset Value (NAV) is the sum of the land bank at current market value, plus completed and under-construction assets, minus net debt. Developers trade at discounts or premiums to NAV depending on execution track record, delivery speed, and the credibility of management.","lines":5,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"A company trading at 0.6x NAV is either ","r":[224,1226.05,570.86,42.25],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"A company trading at 0.6x NAV is either cheap or has an execution problem. The market is asking you to figure out which.","lines":2,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"The delivery cycle risk","r":[224,1322.55,318.94,43],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"The delivery cycle risk","lines":1,"tx":{"s":30,"f":"Poppins","w":300,"lh":34.5,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"Egyptian real estate developers typicall","r":[224,1391.94,601.41,121],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"Egyptian real estate developers typically sell off-plan — units sold before they're built. Revenue is recognized as construction progresses. Cash comes in early; costs come later. This creates a structural mismatch that can look good in good times and dangerous in bad times.","lines":5,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"Wh